{"seq":1,"slug":"backup-and-restore","title":"备份与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/backup-and-restore","wordCount":730,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"备份与恢复\">备份与恢复</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 没有 <code>pg_dump</code> 这类专用备份工具，但单文件架构本身提供了备份优势。真正要解决的问题是<strong>一致性</strong>：直接复制文件可能捕获到写入中途的状态，因此产生了多种方案——离线文件复制、在线 <code>.backup</code> API、原子性的 <code>VACUUM INTO</code>，以及基于 WAL 流式的持续复制。选择哪种，取决于对在线支持、压缩效果与复杂度的取舍。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"备份策略概述\">备份策略概述</h2><p>SQLite 数据库备份不同于传统数据库——没有 <code>pg_dump</code> 这样的专用工具，也没有内置的 binlog 归档机制。但 SQLite 的单文件架构提供了独特的备份优势：数据库就是一个文件，理论上直接复制即可。然而实际操作中需要注意事务一致性和辅助文件的处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 备份方式&#10;        COPY[文件复制]&#10;        BACKUP[.backup API]&#10;        VACUUM[VACUUM INTO]&#10;        STREAM[流式复制&lt;br/&gt;Litestream]&#10;    end&#10;    COPY --&gt;|最简单&lt;br/&gt;需要锁| OFFLINE[离线备份]&#10;    BACKUP --&gt;|在线备份&lt;br/&gt;渐进式| ONLINE[在线备份]&#10;    VACUUM --&gt;|原子性&lt;br/&gt;重建压缩| COMPACT[压缩备份]&#10;    STREAM --&gt;|持续复制&lt;br/&gt;WAL 流式| REALTIME[实时备份]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 备份方式\n        COPY[文件复制]\n        BACKUP[.backup API]\n        VACUUM[VACUUM INTO]\n        STREAM[流式复制&lt;br/&gt;Litestream]\n    end\n    COPY --&gt;|最简单&lt;br/&gt;需要锁| OFFLINE[离线备份]\n    BACKUP --&gt;|在线备份&lt;br/&gt;渐进式| ONLINE[在线备份]\n    VACUUM --&gt;|原子性&lt;br/&gt;重建压缩| COMPACT[压缩备份]\n    STREAM --&gt;|持续复制&lt;br/&gt;WAL 流式| REALTIME[实时备份]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>备份方式</th>\n<th>在线支持</th>\n<th>一致性保证</th>\n<th>压缩效果</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件复制</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需要锁</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.backup 命令</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VACUUM INTO</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Litestream</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件复制备份\">文件复制备份</h2><p>最直接的备份方式是复制数据库文件。但必须确保复制时没有活跃的写事务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 在 WAL 模式下，需要同时复制三个文件：&#10;-- myapp.db&#10;-- myapp.db-wal&#10;-- myapp.db-shm&#10;&#10;-- 或者先执行 checkpoint 将 WAL 合并&#10;PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE);&#10;-- 此时只需复制 myapp.db\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在 WAL 模式下，需要同时复制三个文件：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- myapp.db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- myapp.db-wal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- myapp.db-shm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 或者先执行 checkpoint 将 WAL 合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TRUNCATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 此时只需复制 myapp.db</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;import { copyFileSync } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;&#10;function fileBackup(dbPath: string, backupPath: string) {&#10;  const db = new Database(dbPath, { readonly: true });&#10;&#10;  db.pragma(&#39;wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)&#39;);&#10;&#10;  db.close();&#10;&#10;  copyFileSync(dbPath, backupPath);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { copyFileSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fileBackup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">backupPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath, { readonly: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  copyFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath, backupPath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 WAL 模式下，如果只复制主数据库文件而不复制 <code>-wal</code> 文件，备份可能缺少最近提交但尚未 checkpoint 的数据。始终先执行 <code>wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)</code> 或同时复制所有辅助文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"backup-api\">.backup API</h2><p>SQLite 的 <strong>Online Backup API</strong> 允许在数据库运行中进行热备份，不会阻塞读写操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function onlineBackup(dbPath: string, backupPath: string) {&#10;  const db = new Database(dbPath);&#10;&#10;  await db.backup(backupPath, {&#10;    progress({ totalPages, remainingPages }) {&#10;      const pct = Math.round(((totalPages - remainingPages) / totalPages) * 100);&#10;      console.log(`备份进度: ${pct}%`);&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  db.close();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onlineBackup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">backupPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">backup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backupPath, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">totalPages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">remainingPages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(((totalPages </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remainingPages) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalPages) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`备份进度: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pct</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant APP as 应用&#10;    participant SRC as 源数据库&#10;    participant DST as 备份文件&#10;&#10;    APP-&gt;&gt;SRC: backup(dst) 开始&#10;    loop 每批页面&#10;        SRC-&gt;&gt;DST: 复制 N 个页面&#10;        Note over SRC: 源库可继续读写&#10;    end&#10;    APP-&gt;&gt;SRC: 备份完成\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant APP as 应用\n    participant SRC as 源数据库\n    participant DST as 备份文件\n\n    APP-&gt;&gt;SRC: backup(dst) 开始\n    loop 每批页面\n        SRC-&gt;&gt;DST: 复制 N 个页面\n        Note over SRC: 源库可继续读写\n    end\n    APP-&gt;&gt;SRC: 备份完成</pre><p>Online Backup 的工作机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>阻塞影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>获取源库共享锁</td>\n<td>不阻塞写者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>批量复制页面到目标文件</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>如果源库有变更，重新复制变更页</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>完成后释放锁</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vacuum-into\">VACUUM INTO</h2><p><strong>VACUUM INTO</strong> 将整个数据库重建并写入新文件，同时压缩碎片。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 将数据库重建到新文件&#10;VACUUM INTO &#39;/backups/myapp-20260401.db&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 将数据库重建到新文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VACUUM </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/backups/myapp-20260401.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;function vacuumBackup(dbPath: string, backupPath: string) {&#10;  const db = new Database(dbPath, { readonly: true });&#10;  db.exec(`VACUUM INTO &#39;${backupPath}&#39;`);&#10;  db.close();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> vacuumBackup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">backupPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath, { readonly: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`VACUUM INTO '${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">backupPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>.backup</th>\n<th>VACUUM INTO</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碎片整理</td>\n<td>否（原样复制）</td>\n<td>是（重建压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空闲页回收</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行速度</td>\n<td>快（渐进式）</td>\n<td>较慢（完整重建）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>源库锁</td>\n<td>共享锁</td>\n<td>共享锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果文件大小</td>\n<td>与源库相同</td>\n<td>通常更小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> VACUUM INTO 产生的备份文件通常比 .backup 更小，因为它会消除碎片和空闲页面。但对于大型数据库，执行时间明显更长。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动备份方案\">自动备份方案</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;import { mkdirSync, readdirSync, unlinkSync, statSync } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;import { join } from &#39;node:path&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface BackupConfig {&#10;  dbPath: string;&#10;  backupDir: string;&#10;  maxBackups: number;&#10;  intervalMs: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function setupAutoBackup(config: BackupConfig) {&#10;  mkdirSync(config.backupDir, { recursive: true });&#10;&#10;  const backup = async () =&gt; {&#10;    const timestamp = new Date().toISOString().replace(/[:.]/g, &#39;-&#39;);&#10;    const backupPath = join(config.backupDir, `backup-${timestamp}.db`);&#10;&#10;    const db = new Database(config.dbPath);&#10;    await db.backup(backupPath);&#10;    db.close();&#10;&#10;    rotateBackups(config.backupDir, config.maxBackups);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  setInterval(backup, config.intervalMs);&#10;&#10;  return backup;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rotateBackups(dir: string, maxCount: number) {&#10;  const files = readdirSync(dir)&#10;    .filter((f) =&gt; f.startsWith(&#39;backup-&#39;) &amp;&amp; f.endsWith(&#39;.db&#39;))&#10;    .map((f) =&gt; ({ name: f, path: join(dir, f), mtime: statSync(join(dir, f)).mtime }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.mtime.getTime() - a.mtime.getTime());&#10;&#10;  for (const file of files.slice(maxCount)) {&#10;    unlinkSync(file.path);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { mkdirSync, readdirSync, unlinkSync, statSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8